C5 R17-2 r172_dressing.py; m = 0.3

(A) dressing identity. For each defect mode and random qhat (|q| = 1e-3), Xi = Phi_c/delta_c from R16-12's T3 solve.
    A1 Hamiltonian: {C_s^(1)[N], W} = i N s.Xi_E f  ->  need s.Xi_E = -i eps  (so the bracket is N eps f = T00[N])
    A2 momentum:    {C_j^(1)[xi], W} = -2 xi.(q.Xi_h) f -> need q.Xi_h = P/2 = eps v/2 (bracket = P^m[xi], sign as A1)
    A3 TT cloud: the GR comoving field of the W1 stress at frequency omega=q.v solves hdot=2E, Edot=-(q^2/2)h - sigma0 f:
       h_TT = 2 sigma0_TT f/(omega^2-q^2), E_TT = -i omega sigma0_TT f/(omega^2-q^2). Dressing shifts: dh = -i Xi_E f, dE = +i Xi_h f.
       Report ratios dh_T/h^GR_T, dh_TT/h^GR_TT, dE_TT/E^GR_TT (GR Newtonian h^GR_T: s.h = eps f -> coeff on (I-qq) = -eps/(2q^2)).
  S(1.4) k=[1.6 1.6 0. ] |v|=0.3351: A1 max rel err 8.2e-16; A2 max rel err 2.1e-10; A3 ratios (Newton, h_TT, E_TT): max|r+1| = 6.4e-08 over 400 samples
  G(1.4) k=[2.  0.3 0.2] |v|=0.7970: A1 max rel err 6.6e-16; A2 max rel err 5.0e-10; A3 ratios (Newton, h_TT, E_TT): max|r+1| = 1.7e-08 over 200 samples
  G(1.4) k=[ 2.6  0.1 -0.4] |v|=0.2284: A1 max rel err 7.7e-16; A2 max rel err 1.5e-10; A3 ratios (Newton, h_TT, E_TT): max|r+1| = 7.3e-09 over 200 samples
  G(1.4) k=[1.6 1.6 0. ] |v|=0.9908: A1 max rel err 7.8e-16; A2 max rel err 1.8e-10; A3 ratios (Newton, h_TT, E_TT): max|r+1| = 4.3e-09 over 400 samples
  G(1.4) k=[ 2.3 -1.9  0.7] |v|=0.7001: A1 max rel err 9.0e-16; A2 max rel err 1.9e-10; A3 ratios (Newton, h_TT, E_TT): max|r+1| = 3.3e-09 over 400 samples

(B) T3 equations = dressing equations: {W, H0} = -i[E.(-i om Xi_E + G Xi_h) + h.(-i om Xi_h - K Xi_E)] f.
    Claim: E-part has only L components (qq, vL) and h-part equals -sigma0 f up to T component (transverse trace).
    => e^{-W}: H = H0 + h.sigma0 f  ->  H0 + {E_L, h_T}-proportional terms (weakly H0). Show components:
